  "title": "U.S. Returns $12.26 Billion in Oil Proceeds to Venezuela",
  "summary": "The U.S. returned over $12 billion in oil revenue to Venezuela since President Nicolas Maduro's ouster, with most funds going to the country under a deal reached with interim authorities. The report highlights ongoing tensions and the return of funds under the terms of a broader energy agreement.",
